{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130800079611891712064217.jpeg/Ze5gFsa_McLRFk92cedBOBSVQ8RU7eH25RWrh-UVq4c\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:1em\"><p>5月12日，湖南衡陽雁峰區應急管理局發佈情況通報，衡陽市雁峰區厲家沖社區一居民樓當天凌晨3時許發生火災，造成五人死亡，兩人受傷，傷者正在積極</p><p>相關善後工作和事故原因調查正在開展中。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-12T01:38:59.353402+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":90,"images":1,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none"}}